/T (Nuxt 3's auto-import system and zero-configuration composables offer comparable velocity for Vue developers. However, for a TypeScript-first atomic design system with strict component boundaries \(as required by this project\), Next.js's explicit imports provide better IDE support and tree-shakability. )
/E (Nuxt 3's auto-import system and zero-configuration composables offer comparable velocity for Vue developers. However, for a TypeScript-first atomic design system with strict component boundaries \(as required by this project\), Next.js's explicit imports provide better IDE support and tree-shakability. )
